### 27. 34420187 | 2021 | Colchicine effectively attenuates inflammatory biomarker high-sensitivity C-reactive protein (hs-CRP) in patients with non-ST-segment elevation myocardial infarction: a randomised, double-blind, placebo-controlled clinical trial.
pubtypes: Journal Article; Randomized Controlled Trial
